# Project: UoP Salary Calculator

## What it is
Standalone HTML salary calculator for Polish UoP (umowa o pracę) + B2B comparison.
Target audience: **expats in Polish IT**. Primary user: Serhii, QA Automation Engineer, Wrocław.

## Files
- `kalkulator_uop.html` — the entire app (single file, no build step, opens in browser)
- `verify_math.py` — math verifier, run before any tax formula change
- `.cursor/rules/` — these agent rules

## Tech stack
Single HTML file. Vanilla JS. No framework. No server. No npm. CSS inline.
To syntax-check JS: extract `<script>` block → `node --check /tmp/check.js`

## Key constants (do not change without tax-expert approval)
- ZUS cap 2026: 282 600 PLN | 2025: 260 190 | 2024: 234 720
- ZUS rates (employee): em 9.76%, re 1.5%, ch 2.45%, health 9%
- ZUS rates (B2B full): em 19.52%, re 8%, wyp 1.67%, FP 2.45%, ch 2.45% optional
- KUP annual limit: 120 000 PLN | flat fallback: 250 PLN/month
- Tax brackets: 12% up to 120 000 PLN cumulative income, 32% above
- Kwota wolna: 300 PLN/month tax reduction

## Calibration baseline (2025, 27 000 PLN brutto)
Jan/Feb exact match: 19 867,99 PLN. Annual error target: <1.5%.
Run `python3 verify_math.py` to validate. PASS = all modellable months within ±150 PLN.

## Languages
All UI text is bilingual EN/PL. Translation object `T` in JS. Always add both languages.
